# <%= className %> Microservice

Python microservice using **<%= framework %>** and managed via **uv**.

## Commands

- `nx serve <%= fileName %>` - Run dev server
- `nx lint <%= fileName %>` - Run Ruff linter
- `nx format <%= fileName %>` - Run Ruff formatter
- `nx test <%= fileName %>` - Run Pytest suite
- `nx typecheck <%= fileName %>` - Run Mypy type checker
<% if (framework === 'grpc') { -%>
- `nx proto <%= fileName %>` - Compile Protobuf files
<% } -%>
